      "text": "Breakfast. Meet your English-speaking guide in the hotel lobby at the appointed time for a sightseeing tour of the historic city, a UNESCO World Heritage Site.\n\nCartagena sits on Colombia's Caribbean coast. The historic center is ringed by kilometers of defensive walls, and the old town still feels like a fortress in its own right.\n\nYou'll visit Castillo San Felipe de Barajas, a 17th-century fortress, before continuing past old churches and well-known landmarks in Cartagena de Indias.\n\nAnother stop is Cerro de la Popa and its hilltop monastery, where you'll have a panoramic view of the city.\n\nCartagena remains a lively Caribbean city, with restaurants, diverse cuisine, and plenty of places to stroll after the tour.\n\nReturn to the five-star hotel. Time to relax."
    },
